      "diff": "@@ -29,7 +29,8 @@ If you or your organization would like to contribute or become a sponsor, please\n \n The following changes have been made since version 0.9.2:\n \n-* Nothing of note.\n+* The Windows installers now ship with Qt 6.8.3.\n+  They previously shipped with Qt 6.8.1.\n \n The following changes have been made since version 0.9.1:\n \n",
      "collapsed": false,
      "too_large": false,
      "new_path": "doc/Stratoshark_Release_Notes.adoc",
      "old_path": "doc/Stratoshark_Release_Notes.adoc",
      "a_mode": "100644",
      "b_mode": "100644",
      "new_file": false,
      "renamed_file": false,
      "deleted_file": false,
      "generated_file": false
    },
    {
      "diff": "@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@ The following features are either new or have been significantly updated since v\n * The Windows installers now ship with Npcap 1.83.\n   They previously shipped with Npcap 1.79.\n \n-* The Windows installers now ship with Qt 6.8.1.\n+* The Windows installers now ship with Qt 6.8.3.\n   They previously shipped with Qt 6.5.3.\n \n * WinPcap is no longer supported. On Windows, use Npcap instead, uninstalling\n",
      "collapsed": false,
      "too_large": false,
      "new_path": "doc/Wireshark_Release_Notes.adoc",
      "old_path": "doc/Wireshark_Release_Notes.adoc",
      "a_mode": "100644",
      "b_mode": "100644",
      "new_file": false,
      "renamed_file": false,
      "deleted_file": false,
      "generated_file": false
    },
    {
      "diff": "@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@ variables:\n   GIT_FETCH_EXTRA_FLAGS: \"--depth=5000\"\n   CCACHE_DIR: \"${CI_PROJECT_DIR}/ccache\"\n   # The Qt versions that we ship in the development installers.\n-  WINDOWS_QT_VERSION: \"6.8.1\"\n+  WINDOWS_QT_VERSION: \"6.8.3\"\n   MACOS_QT_VERSION: \"6.8.3\"\n   # Enable color output in various tools.\n   # CMake, Ninja, and others: https://bixense.com/clicolors/\n@@ -178,16 +178,26 @@ workflow:\n   rules: !reference [.if-2x-daily-schedule]\n \n .build-windows:\n+  variables:\n+    AQT_HOST: \"windows\"\n+    AQT_ARCH: \"msvc2022_64\"\n+    VCVARS_ARCH: \"64\"\n   stage: build\n   retry: 1\n   before_script:\n+    - if (-Not (Test-Path C:\\Qt)) { New-Item -Path C:\\Qt -ItemType \"directory\" }\n+    - if (-Not (Test-Path \"C:\\Qt\\$($env:WINDOWS_QT_VERSION)\\$($env:AQT_ARCH)\\include\\QtCore\")) {\n+        py.exe -m venv \"$($env:TEMP)\\aqt.venv\" ;\n+        & $env:TEMP\\aqt.venv\\Scripts\\pip3.exe install aqtinstall ;\n+        & $env:TEMP\\aqt.venv\\Scripts\\aqt.exe install-qt --outputdir C:\\Qt $env:AQT_HOST desktop $env:WINDOWS_QT_VERSION \"win64_$($env:AQT_ARCH)\" --modules qt5compat qtmultimedia ;\n+      }\n     - if (-Not (Test-Path C:\\Development)) { New-Item -Path C:\\Development -ItemType \"directory\" }\n     - $env:WIRESHARK_BASE_DIR = \"C:\\Development\"\n     - $env:Configuration = \"RelWithDebInfo\"\n     - $env:Path += \";C:\\Program Files\\CMake\\bin\"\n-    - $env:CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH = \"C:\\qt\\$($env:WINDOWS_QT_VERSION)\\msvc2022_64\"\n+    - $env:CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH = \"C:\\Qt\\$($env:WINDOWS_QT_VERSION)\\$($env:AQT_ARCH)\"\n     # https://help.appveyor.com/discussions/questions/18777-how-to-use-vcvars64bat-from-powershell\n-    - cmd.exe /c \"call `\"C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\2022\\Community\\VC\\Auxiliary\\Build\\vcvars64.bat`\" && set \" | Foreach-Object { if ($_ -match \"^(.*?)=(.*)$\") { Set-Content \"env:\\$($matches[1])\" $matches[2] } }\n+    - cmd.exe /c \"call `\"C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\2022\\Community\\VC\\Auxiliary\\Build\\vcvars$($env:VCVARS_ARCH).bat`\" && set \" | Foreach-Object { if ($_ -match \"^(.*?)=(.*)$\") { Set-Content \"env:\\$($matches[1])\" $matches[2] } }\n     # Testing / debugging only.\n     # - cmd.exe /c \"set CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE\"\n     # - cmd.exe /c \"set CI_PROJECT_URL\"\n@@ -551,18 +561,14 @@ Windows x64 Package:\n       - build/*shark-release-info-*-windows-*.ini\n \n Windows Arm64 Package:\n+  variables:\n+    AQT_HOST: \"windows_arm64\"\n+    AQT_ARCH: \"msvc2022_arm64\"\n+    VCVARS_ARCH: \"arm64\"\n   extends: .build-windows\n   rules: !reference [.if-w-w-only-merged]\n   tags:\n     - wireshark-windows-arm64-package\n-  before_script:\n-    - $env:WIRESHARK_BASE_DIR = \"C:\\Development\"\n-    - $env:Configuration = \"RelWithDebInfo\"\n-    - $env:CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH = \"C:\\Qt\\$($env:WINDOWS_QT_VERSION)\\msvc2022_arm64\"\n-    # https://help.appveyor.com/discussions/questions/18777-how-to-use-vcvars64bat-from-powershell\n-    - cmd.exe /c \"call `\"C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\2022\\Community\\VC\\Auxiliary\\Build\\vcvarsarm64.bat`\" && set\" | Foreach-Object { if ($_ -match \"^(.*?)=(.*)$\") { Set-Content \"env:\\$($matches[1])\" $matches[2] } }\n-    - mkdir build\n-    - cd build\n   script:\n     - C:\\Windows\\py.exe ..\\tools\\make-version.py --set-release --wireshark-version-file=wireshark_version.txt --stratoshark-version-file=stratoshark_version.txt ..\n     - cmake -G \"Visual Studio 17 2022\" -A arm64\n",
